omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HBurepqtyUEQ7kNvwEpf7Gz&_nc_oc=Adq_1NqiH_DeeLTt08yqezlXgttu7pv50PvhgxpQesb-_EiG7yGn4sK3nlM5ezyyjtY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_ktrFRcknQHzf2vEaQ-PWEpCElcu6ePghu_24k6Hc_-Q&oe=6A3FEAB4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ExV8BDTKVvcQ7kNvwFd5t8A&_nc_oc=AdoP26PL2bP1qxOUIu3JwxbLsVlnbP0tFLqDq1Kp9qXCmA52SSDu0oCNSBkY89I9jzc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_SlRn7lfLhl2nuYkRctAfNneTaY7qinbI2S9_koFyhBw&oe=6A3FEC16"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rzlw8tpTIE0Q7kNvwEyRfEv&_nc_oc=Adp7sKhR0bcA9XjItfGOK716u1JVLVMJ-NMrjxkYpskFYGUP4R-dxrIz0k0xwcyg_0I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9F5kw6Aj4DnPYAJ9zUUS0HJDf9RQ8oBZ_50xqg36hxYA&oe=6A3FC8F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://